  "description": "Round-trip AsciiDoc emitter for Adoc.Net: serialises an AST back to AsciiDoc source, with an optional source-anchored fast path that preserves byte-identical formatting for unchanged subtrees.",
  "id": "AdocNet.Emitter",
  "isPrerelease": false,
